('271g7quloc','2026-11-15 12:38:44.937185','2026-11-15 12:38:44.937185','syn.app.0001@example.invalid','syn.app.0001@example.invalid',0,2,'assistant','Your application already met the conditions in this demo check.  \n\n- Keep your job stable and continue paying any existing EMIs on time.  \n- Maintain a good credit report by avoiding missed payments.  \n- Ensure all personal details stay accurate and up‑to‑date.  \n\nYou can come back when your situation changes or ask for a human review.\n\n(These limits come from a synthetic prototype policy used for this demo, not from a real lender\'s policy.)','0d3ed85f-d2ff-4b9c-83ae-9546ea9c0d29','messages','Advisory Conversation'),
('271k7hmvoj','2026-11-15 12:38:44.935886','2026-11-15 12:38:44.935886','syn.app.0001@example.invalid','syn.app.0001@example.invalid',0,1,'user','What can I do to improve before reapplying?','0d3ed85f-d2ff-4b9c-83ae-9546ea9c0d29','messages','Advisory Conversation'),
('804eomc5jb','2026-11-15 13:43:14.011550','2026-11-15 13:43:14.011550','syn.app.0001@example.invalid','syn.app.0001@example.invalid',0,2,'assistant','We can’t give you the full amount you asked for, but we can offer a smaller loan.  \n- Some of the documents you provided were incomplete or unclear.  \n- Because of that we made a lower offer.  \n\nYou can accept this offer, ask about a different amount, or request a human review.\n\n(These limits come from a synthetic prototype policy used for this demo, not from a real lender\'s policy.)','8c25187c-2dc6-4e39-bd8f-e325cbc703cf','messages','Advisory Conversation'),
('804kmm6jb4','2026-11-15 13:43:14.009969','2026-11-15 13:43:14.009969','syn.app.0001@example.invalid','syn.app.0001@example.invalid',0,1,'user','why i was counter offered?','8c25187c-2dc6-4e39-bd8f-e325cbc703cf','messages','Advisory Conversation'),
