('a5f9ji65ah','2026-11-15 15:36:09.538533','2026-11-15 15:36:09.538533','ravi.kumar@example.invalid','ravi.kumar@example.invalid',0,2,'assistant','Hello! How can I help you today?','879aa23d-4df3-4716-8cf9-c764112b14b8','messages','Advisory Conversation'),
('a98n83knq9','2026-11-15 15:36:21.652928','2026-11-15 15:36:21.652928','ravi.kumar@example.invalid','ravi.kumar@example.invalid',0,4,'assistant','I’m Saral’s conversational assistant. I’m here to help answer general questions and provide information about Saral’s services. If you need details about specific rates, eligibility, fees, or the status of an application, I won’t be able to verify those in this mode, but I can give you general guidance. How can I assist you today?','879aa23d-4df3-4716-8cf9-c764112b14b8','messages','Advisory Conversation'),
('a98njsbft6','2026-11-15 15:36:21.651301','2026-11-15 15:36:21.651301','ravi.kumar@example.invalid','ravi.kumar@example.invalid',0,3,'user','who are you?','879aa23d-4df3-4716-8cf9-c764112b14b8','messages','Advisory Conversation'),
