('eehigm7uh4','2026-11-15 14:48:51.373101','2026-11-15 14:48:51.373101','ravi.kumar@example.invalid','ravi.kumar@example.invalid',0,1,'user','What are my loan details','a9da91b2-c5a7-429a-826c-2706f730d03d','messages','Advisory Conversation'),
('eibfv8vcsn','2026-11-15 13:54:26.716668','2026-11-15 13:54:26.716668','ravi.kumar@example.invalid','ravi.kumar@example.invalid',0,1,'user','which information are needed to continue?','9fcaecde-a9c0-46bc-840a-72160317bbda','messages','Advisory Conversation'),
('eibs7j43o1','2026-11-15 13:54:26.718048','2026-11-15 13:54:26.718048','ravi.kumar@example.invalid','ravi.kumar@example.invalid',0,2,'assistant','To help you move forward, I’ll need a few basic details about what you’re trying to do. For example:\n\n1. **Purpose** – Are you looking to start a new loan application, check the status of an existing one, or get information about a different service?  \n2. **Personal details** – Full name, date of birth, and a contact method (phone or email) so we know which account you’re referring to.  \n3. **Loan specifics** – Desired loan amount, repayment term, and the type of loan (personal, auto, home, etc.).  \n4. **Supporting documents** – Typically a proof of identity, address proof, and income verification (pay slip, bank statement, tax return, etc.).  \n\nIf you let me know which of these you already have or which step you’re on, I can tell you exactly what’s needed next.','9fcaecde-a9c0-46bc-840a-72160317bbda','messages','Advisory Conversation'),
('eoabvc6215','2026-11-15 13:54:45.859887','2026-11-15 13:54:45.859887','ravi.kumar@example.invalid','ravi.kumar@example.invalid',0,4,'assistant','Your application could not be assessed yet because some information is missing: your date of birth, your nationality, your type of job, a check of your identity, your salary credits in your bank statement, your credit history details, some documents, your identity documents, your consent to the loan terms and privacy notice, your PAN, documents for the loan purpose, the purpose of the loan, your income documents, such as salary slips. Once it is provided, the application is assessed again. I can\'t fill it in for you.','9fcaecde-a9c0-46bc-840a-72160317bbda','messages','Advisory Conversation'),
('eoai78n67f','2026-11-15 13:54:45.858939','2026-11-15 13:54:45.858939','ravi.kumar@example.invalid','ravi.kumar@example.invalid',0,3,'user','what is the status of my current application?','9fcaecde-a9c0-46bc-840a-72160317bbda','messages','Advisory Conversation'),
