('Create Journal Entry','2026-10-04 01:25:22.675609','2026-10-04 01:39:31.634775','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'Post a journal entry',0,0,'For anything that isn\'t an invoice or a payment: accruals, depreciation, or fixing a mistake. See [Journal Entry](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/journal-entry).','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AGTMkzfqtbE','Create Entry','Create Journal Entry','Journal Entry',NULL,1,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
