('Create Work Order','2026-02-20 13:32:09.873246','2026-10-04 01:49:02.873751','Administrator','Administrator',0,1,'Plan a work order',0,0,'Decide how many to make. The raw materials you need are worked out from the BOM. See [Work Order](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/work-order).','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O2DBcberucw','Create Entry','Create Work Order','Work Order',NULL,1,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
